<section class="hero"><div class="frame hero-grid"><div>
  <p class="eyebrow">Programs &amp; process · Central Texas</p><h1>Your plans.<br>A clear way forward.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Explore the kinds of inquiries staff can review, then confirm written terms before making a decision.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button gold" href="/bookings/new">Start a rental inquiry →</a><a class="button on-dark" href="#steps">See the process</a></div>
</div><aside class="hero-note"><p class="eyebrow">Review before release</p><strong>No automatic booking.</strong><p>An estimate, submitted inquiry or internal review status by itself is not permission to pick up a vehicle.</p></aside></div></section>
<div class="frame section">
  <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Plan your rental</p><h2>What are you driving for?</h2></div><p>These options guide your inquiry. They are not availability commitments or published rate packages.</p></div>
  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">01 · Everyday travel</p><h3>A short-term trip.</h3><p>Share requested times and vehicle needs. Ask for the written total and return conditions.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">02 · More time</p><h3>A longer stay.</h3><p>Ask whether an extended rental can be considered. Do not assume a longer price, mileage allowance or existing deadline changes.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">03 · Changed plans</p><h3>Temporary transportation.</h3><p>Share the dates and vehicle needs. Insurer reimbursement and direct billing are not promised.</p></article>
  </div>
  <section class="section" id="steps"><p class="eyebrow">Four distinct steps</p><h2>From inquiry to handoff.</h2><ol class="steps">
    <li><strong>Request.</strong><p>Choose a listed vehicle and provide your preferred dates and locations.</p></li>
    <li><strong>Review.</strong><p>Staff checks availability and the applicable terms. Ask about deposits, fees, mileage and coverage obligations.</p></li>
    <li><strong>Confirm.</strong><p>Read the applicable agreement and obtain explicit confirmation. An estimate or status in this alpha does not replace an agreement.</p></li>
    <li><strong>Collect.</strong><p>Follow confirmed pickup instructions. Document vehicle condition, fuel and mileage at handoff.</p></li>
  </ol></section>
  <div class="callout"><div><h2>Before you commit.</h2><p>Confirm requirements separately before entering any payment or identity information. Do not include card numbers, passwords, or identity documents in general inquiries.</p></div><a href="/bookings/new" class="button outline">Open rental request</a></div>
</div>
